WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.762
Reality Check: How Government Purchases Work.

00:00:03.712 --> 00:00:08.200
Before the individuals, look at what your government pays for things.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:14.437
The Phoenix pay system cost over 5 billion dollars for 290,000 employees.

00:00:14.437 --> 00:00:18.950
ArriveCAN cost 54 million for a glorified web form.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:22.650
The markup is not a bug — it is the business model.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:28.125
This section documents the gap between what things cost and what Canadians were charged.
